\subsection{Key terms}

\begin{tabular}{@{}p{3.6cm}p{10.4cm}@{}}
\toprule
\textbf{Term} & \textbf{Meaning} \\
\midrule
Binary counter & A sequential circuit that counts upward in binary with each clock pulse. \\
Shift register & A chain of flip‑flops that moves data one position per clock pulse. \\
Timing diagram & Graphical representation of signal levels versus time. \\
Ripple counter & A counter where each flip‑flop is clocked by the output of the previous stage, causing delay propagation. \\
Synchronous counter & A counter where all flip‑flops receive the same clock edge, eliminating ripple delay. \\
\bottomrule
\end{tabular}
